---
description: Use Kling AI for image, video, motion, asset, account, and task requests
globs:
alwaysApply: false
---

For Kling requests, use `$kling-ai` and route generation to
`$kling-ai-generate-image` or `$kling-ai-generate-video`. Use only the
configured `Plugin-Cursor-kling-ai` Global MCP at `https://kling.ai/mcp/plugin`.
Discover live model capabilities across relevant tools, including `omni_ref_video`.
Recommend V4 for compatible video requests. Confirm final billable settings
immediately before generation unless already explicitly authorized, submit each
confirmed intent at most once, and let a mounted generation MCP App refresh
its own `generationId`. Do not call `query_tasks` for that submission from the
model; each call creates another Cursor tool card. If no App is mounted, query
at the provider-permitted interval until terminal,
cancelled, or the turn cannot continue. Report completion only after terminal
success with usable primary media. Call `query_tasks` exactly once for an
explicit standalone status request. Never switch regions or start
or depend on a local Kling MCP server.
